WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.012
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Sarah. Welcome to Online A one, Book three.

2
00:00:06.312 --> 00:00:09.571
Hi! I'm Rithy. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:09.871 --> 00:00:15.727
Unit fourteen: Kind Actions. In this unit, you will talk about kind things you did.

4
00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:17.462
Kind.

5
00:00:18.162 --> 00:00:20.893
Kind means nice and helpful to other people.

6
00:00:21.193 --> 00:00:23.042
My sister is very kind.

7
00:00:23.742 --> 00:00:26.638
Your turn. Say: Kind.

8
00:00:29.338 --> 00:00:30.072
Kind.

9
00:00:31.083 --> 00:00:31.852
Help.

10
00:00:32.552 --> 00:00:34.761
Help means to do something for someone.

11
00:00:35.061 --> 00:00:36.549
I helped my grandma.

12
00:00:37.249 --> 00:00:40.935
Your turn. Say: Help.

13
00:00:43.635 --> 00:00:44.369
Help.

14
00:00:45.383 --> 00:00:46.094
Share.

15
00:00:46.794 --> 00:00:49.769
Share means to let someone use something of yours.

16
00:00:50.069 --> 00:00:51.720
I shared my crayons.

17
00:00:52.420 --> 00:00:55.096
Your turn. Say: Share.

18
00:00:57.796 --> 00:00:58.472
Share.

19
00:00:59.483 --> 00:01:00.426
Smile.

20
00:01:01.126 --> 00:01:03.497
Smile means to make a happy face.

21
00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.553
She smiled at the new student.

22
00:01:06.253 --> 00:01:08.778
Your turn. Say: Smile.

23
00:01:11.478 --> 00:01:12.490
Smile.

24
00:01:13.483 --> 00:01:14.090
Thank.

25
00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:17.358
Thank means to say thank you to someone.

26
00:01:17.658 --> 00:01:19.228
I thanked my teacher.

27
00:01:19.928 --> 00:01:22.348
Your turn. Say: Thank.

28
00:01:25.048 --> 00:01:25.759
Thank.

29
00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:27.693
Carry.

30
00:01:28.393 --> 00:01:31.136
Carry means to hold something and take it somewhere.

31
00:01:31.436 --> 00:01:32.866
I carried her bags.

32
00:01:33.566 --> 00:01:36.579
Your turn. Say: Carry.

33
00:01:39.279 --> 00:01:40.082
Carry.

34
00:01:41.083 --> 00:01:41.887
Neighbour.

35
00:01:42.587 --> 00:01:45.097
Neighbour means a person who lives near you.

36
00:01:45.397 --> 00:01:46.735
My neighbour is old.

37
00:01:47.435 --> 00:01:49.995
Your turn. Say: Neighbour.

38
00:01:52.695 --> 00:01:53.371
Neighbour.

39
00:01:54.383 --> 00:01:55.187
Happy.

40
00:01:55.887 --> 00:01:57.631
Happy means feeling good.

41
00:01:57.931 --> 00:02:00.198
Kind actions make people happy.

42
00:02:00.898 --> 00:02:03.469
Your turn. Say: Happy.

43
00:02:06.169 --> 00:02:07.019
Happy.

44
00:02:08.017 --> 00:02:10.353
Now let's listen to a conversation.

45
00:02:10.653 --> 00:02:13.593
Rithy, did you do a kind action this week?

46
00:02:14.883 --> 00:02:17.002
Yes! I helped my neighbour.

47
00:02:18.317 --> 00:02:19.399
What did you do?

48
00:02:20.683 --> 00:02:22.567
I carried her heavy bags home.

49
00:02:23.883 --> 00:02:25.059
How did she feel?

50
00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.502
She smiled and thanked me. I felt happy too!

51
00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:34.511
Grammar focus: Past simple (helped and shared).

52
00:02:34.811 --> 00:02:38.183
I helped my neighbour. I shared my crayons.

53
00:02:38.483 --> 00:02:45.269
Add -ed for regular verbs. If the verb ends in -y after a consonant, change y to i: carried.

54
00:02:46.283 --> 00:02:48.796
Now read and listen. A Kind Week.

55
00:02:49.096 --> 00:02:52.698
On Monday, I helped my neighbour carry her bags.

56
00:02:53.983 --> 00:02:57.248
On Wednesday, I shared my crayons with a classmate.

57
00:02:58.550 --> 00:03:02.187
On Friday, I smiled at a new student and played with him.

58
00:03:03.483 --> 00:03:04.926
Everyone thanked me.

59
00:03:06.217 --> 00:03:09.726
Being kind makes everyone happy, including me!

60
00:03:11.017 --> 00:03:13.750
Quiz time! Choose the correct answer.

61
00:03:14.050 --> 00:03:16.410
Yesterday, I blank my neighbour.

62
00:03:16.710 --> 00:03:21.605
A, help. B, helped. C, helps.

63
00:03:25.617 --> 00:03:27.686
The answer is B: helped.

64
00:03:29.183 --> 00:03:30.777
I blank her bags home.

65
00:03:31.077 --> 00:03:34.695
A, carryed. B, carried. C, carry.

66
00:03:38.683 --> 00:03:41.124
The answer is B: carried.

67
00:03:42.617 --> 00:03:45.173
Nice and helpful to others means blank.

68
00:03:45.473 --> 00:03:48.964
A, kind. B, angry. C, tired.

69
00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.961
The answer is A: kind.

70
00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:00.345
Now it's your turn to speak. What kind action did you do this week?

71
00:04:05.645 --> 00:04:10.721
This week, I helped my little brother with his homework, and I shared my lunch with a friend.

72
00:04:11.021 --> 00:04:12.730
Excellent answer, Rithy!

73
00:04:13.717 --> 00:04:18.598
Great work today! You learned eight new words and past simple (helped and shared).

74
00:04:18.898 --> 00:04:22.363
Today's value is kindness. Be kind to everyone.

75
00:04:22.663 --> 00:04:25.490
See you in Unit fifteen. Goodbye!

76
00:04:25.790 --> 00:04:28.918
Thank you, Ms. Sarah! Bye, everyone!

